          "source": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c0/The_Moon_Is_A_Harsh_Mistress_%28book%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=original",
          "width": 280,
